{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":103,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"0f9343e7-a093-4f3a-89db-bd3286cff8a5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230940217,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"酶催化研究员（多肽合成方向）(J12042)","OrgId":2014516,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责酶促多肽液相合成项目的研发计划，制定与产品工艺开发，设计酶催化合成路线并完成实验验证；\n2. 针对目标多肽序列，筛选、改造或进化关键生物催化剂（连接酶、蛋白酶等），优化反应体系并指导放大生产；\n3. 完成酶的表达与纯化、酶活性检测、酶催化反应条件优化等实验工作；\n4. 及时跟进多肽酶催化合成领域的最新研究动态（如新型连接酶的发现、固定化酶技术、连续流酶催化等），并积极应用于现有项目；\n5.撰写技术报告、专利或学术论文，总结研发成果。","Require":"1. 硕士学历，酶工程、分子生物学、发酵工程、微生物学、生物催化等相关专业；\n2. 具备3年以上酶催化多肽合成相关研发经验（含在校项目经验）；\n3. 熟悉酶催化多肽合成的反应机理与路线设计，产品合成工艺开发，了解并掌握用于酶的改造；\n4. 熟练掌握分子克隆、定向进化技术（如易错PCR、DNA shuffling、半理性设计等）、蛋白表达与纯化、SDS-PAGE、酶活测定等实验技术；\n5. 熟练掌握HPLC、LC-MS、NMR等分析方法；\n6. 具备独立检索、阅读和总结英文文献的能力，英语读写流利（能与国外客户或合作方口语沟通者优先）。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-10T19:12:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"c5f19318-daad-4a23-94d5-68c3790975cb","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230940216,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"分析工程师(J11679)","OrgId":1708628,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 参与并负责HPLC、GC、理化检测、PSD、ICP-MS、NMR、制备色谱、IC、LC-MS、GC-MS仪器的检测工作；\n2. 参与不同阶段化学创新药CMC 项目，负责其中的API、中间体及原料的质量研究以及分析研发检测工作；\n3. 与工艺研发人员协作，提供项目研发过程中的分析支持及相关分析问题的解决，确保结果准确可靠；\n4. 完成所分配的实验室日常管理事务，包括但不限于HPLC、GC、LC-MS、GC-MS等仪器的维护保养，遵守实验室5S规范，参与培训等；\n5. EHS是第一职责，遵守EHS规则是被雇佣的第一条件。必须对所负责业务、区域的安全、健康和环保及自身的安全、健康负责。具体EHS职责按照《EHS责任制》实施。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，分析化学、药物分析、药学、化学等相关专业；\n2. 2年以上化学及制药行业相关工作经验，有相关分析经验者优先；\n3. 熟练使用和操作各类分析仪器；\n4. 具有一定的英文读写能力，能阅读相关专业英文文献；\n5. 工作积极主动，认真负责，执行能力强，具备较强的自我学习能力和团队合作精神和抗压适应能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-10T19:09:39","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"888bce32-9c0e-497f-8f9b-3e29b684e5ac","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230940214,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"结晶工程师(J11720)","OrgId":1708706,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1.\t结晶工艺开发。可完成药物及中间体结晶工艺开发、结晶过程研究，完成小试阶段实验工艺开发，并按规定真实详尽、及时填写实验记录及报告，确保成本的竞争性并符合客户要求；\n2.\t结晶过程转移和放大、生产支持。可制定中试及生产过程方案，并完成各阶段的技术转移，提供技术支持，确保顺利交接；可支持项目的工厂生产；\n3.\t药物固态化学研究及处方前研究。具有一定的固态化学研究能力，可进行API多晶型/成盐/共晶/稳定性/溶解性等固态化学表征、研究，并可为公司固态化学研发部门提供研究方向、工艺数据及样品等支持；可进行API的性质研究、处方筛选等，满足项目在研磨、粒度分布、溶解度、手性拆分、稳定性等方面要求；\n4.\t结晶及相关工艺支持。针对公司研发项目难点，提供结晶生产方面的技术支持，指导及协助其他研发部门解决工艺和技术困难；\n5.\t根据项目完成情况，提交范围内项目结项相关资料，协助项目结项工作的顺利完成；\n6.\t按照公司EHS的准则进行研发活动，确保实验室小试过程的安全，并提供中试放大所需的相关安全数据。","Require":"任职要求：\n1.\t化学工程、制药工程、固态化学，药物制剂等相关专业；\n2.\t硕士、博士学历：有2-3年结晶工艺研发、固态研究相关工作经验者优先，优秀应届生亦可；\n3.\t熟悉结晶过程、工艺开发、结晶开发设备及工业化生产知识，了解化学分析、化工、EHS、放大生产项目知；\n4.\t熟悉PAT、DSC、TGA、XRD、DVS、UPLC、Raman等工具。熟悉Dynochem、CFD等过程模拟软件优先；\n5.\t具备一定的文献检索能力，良好的时间管理及沟通能力；\n6.\t良好的英语能力，良好的英语书面表达能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-10T19:06:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"0417d70d-521e-422a-93a8-bce6f29abdee","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230940213,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"合成工程师(J10694)","OrgId":2857259,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n\n1：根据项目计划，设计并优化合成路线、工艺，完成小试阶段实验，并按规定真实详尽、及时填写实验记录及报告，确保成本的竞争性并符合客户要求； \n2：制定原料及中间体的质量标准，确保产品符合客户质量要求；\n3：协助制定中试实验方案，并协助完成小试到中试的技术转移，提供技术支持，确保顺利交接；负责或协助参与制定中试实验方案及中试生产；\n4：撰写小试、中试总结报告，并提交项目相关资料，确保信息完整性和准确性；\n5：按照公司EHS的准则进行研发活动，负责实验室的行为规范，实施5S要求；.确保实验室小试过程的安全，并提供中试放大所需的相关安全数据；\n6：负责所在实验室的日常工作，及上级交办的其他工作；","Require":"任职要求：\n\n1：本科、硕士学历，化学、有机化学、药物化学、制药工程等相关专业；\n2：1-3年化学或制药行业合成、工艺研发工作经验，有原料药研发和工艺放大的经验；或优秀应届毕业生，了解化学放大生产相关知识；\n3：具有良好的沟通能力，学习能力以及团队协作能力；\n4：英语CET-4，具备良好的英文书写能力，熟练的计算机使用技能。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-10T19:05:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"4fcdfd76-3477-487e-a960-5ba831538ff5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230940211,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"结晶粉体工程师(J12096)","OrgId":1708706,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 根据业务需求开展药物磨粉工艺和结晶工艺开发、优化、过程转移和放大、生产支持等。\n2. 具有一定的药物粉体研究和结晶过程研究能力，可进行API粉体性质表征，衔接结晶工艺的开发和制剂工艺开发，为DS和DP提供工艺数据及样品等支持，满足项目在DS-DP衔接交付的要求。\n3. 负责结晶和磨粉相关的项目管理、客户沟通，针对公司研发项目难点，提供磨粉及结晶工艺开发的技术支持，指导及协助其他研发部门解决工艺和技术困难。\n4. 能够根据项目情况快速选择合适的设备以及磨粉参数条件，并协助、指导项目生产，确保产品符合客户质量要求。\n5. 协助部门负责人建立与持续提升结晶与磨粉相关的专业技术能力及客户认可，确保业务发展和战略实现。\n6. 按照公司EHS的准则进行研发活动，确保实验室小试过程的安全，并提供中试放大所需的相关安全数据。负责实验室的行为规范，实施5S要求。严格遵守实验室及工厂安全规章，进行实验的安全评估及执行相关的工艺安全措施/控制。","Require":"1. 博士、硕士学历，粉体技术、晶体工程、制药工程、工艺工程、化学工程相关专业。\n2. 熟悉药品研发、药物结晶相关知识，熟悉国内外粉体注册申报相关法规，具备粉体研发相关工作经验者优先。\n3. 熟悉研发及生产的磨粉设备，对于粉体相关及结晶固态仪器熟练使用。\n4. 熟练的英语书面和口头沟通能力，海归博士优先。\n5. 良好的沟通表达能力、团队协作能力和管理能力。\n6. 能够独立计划和完成工作，较强的多任务处理能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-10T19:04:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"fde8a3b6-b5be-45fe-9f64-209303fdb17d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230933898,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"User Leader（喷雾干燥方向）(J12079)","OrgId":1708650,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 工艺技术主导与设计审查：基于 CDMO 多功能车间建设与使用经验，对工艺流程设计、设备选型、车间布局（如人流/物流/废流走向）提出专业意见，确保设计满足多功能、柔性化生产需求；把关工艺适配性，确保工艺路线设计兼顾当前产品需求与未来潜在承接品种的兼容性。\n2. 喷雾干燥设备技术把关：主导喷雾干燥设备的技术规格制定与评审：基于 PSD-3 / PSD-4 级别喷雾干燥设备的使用经验，确定设备关键参数（进风温度、雾化方式、粒径分布控制、收率等）。\n3. 系统集成与清洗策略审查\n审查喷雾干燥系统与清洗系统的集成方案：基于manifold集成策略，审查喷雾干燥系统与 CIP（在线清洗）/ SIP 系统的接口设计、管路集成、清洗覆盖率及交叉污染防控方案。\n确保清洗验证可落地：从运营角度审查清洗系统的设计是否便于后续验证和日常维护，避免建成后清洗不彻底或验证困难。\n参与设备 FAT/SAT：对喷雾干燥系统进行工厂验收和现场验收，确保设备性能达标。\n4. 建设期设计参与与施工监督\n设计阶段：参与工艺设计、设备规格书、P&ID 图纸、URS（用户需求说明）的编制与评审，确保技术需求被准确传递给设计方和供应商。\n施工阶段：监督工艺关键安装质量，参与关键节点检查，确保\"按图施工\"且质量满足 GMP 要求。\n5. 运营准备与交接\n编制运营准备计划：基于 3 年以上生产管理经验，提前规划组织架构、人员配置、培训方案、SOP 体系搭建及生产计划。\n主导投产前的运营准备：确保人员到位、SOP 覆盖、验证完成、质量体系衔接后，车间能顺利从建设期切换到运营期。\n6. 跨方沟通与协调\n对外技术沟通：凭借流利的英语沟通能力，承担与国外设备供应商、技术专家、跨国客户的技术对接、技术澄清及文档审阅工作。\n项目组内协调：在 Owner、Project Leader和 User Leader三方架构中，就工艺技术和运营需求与各方对齐，确保建设决策兼顾运营可行性。","Require":"1.具备项目背景，有搭建或使用CDMO多功能车间的经验；\n2.有搭建和使用搭载PSD-3或PSD-4的喷雾干燥设备的经验，熟悉喷雾干燥系统与清洗系统的歧管集成策略\n3.拥有3年以上生产管理经验，且具备流利的英语沟通能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-27T09:07:18","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"eaba511b-a530-4ede-b435-757bcbdb0685","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230920817,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"多肽液相合成研究员(J12045)","OrgId":2014516,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1.    负责多肽液相合成项目的小试工艺开发、放大及生产。\n2.    负责文献查询与路线设计 \n3.    撰写本人负责项目的周报。 \n4.    参与部门内多肽类项目的技术讨论\n5.    与分析、多肽车间等部门之间沟通，保证多肽项目执行。\n6.    部门内部知识培训 \n7.    实验室的EHS管理","Require":"任职要求：\n1.    有机化学、药物化学等相关专业，本科及以上学历\n2.    硕士2年及以上或本科5年及以上相关工作经验，其中至少含1年多肽领域内科研或企业经验 \n3.    了解天然氨基酸和非天然氨基酸的缩合体系，对液相合成过程中的杂质控制有一定经验\n4.    具有公斤级短肽的液相合成生产经验\n5.    具有GMP生产经验优先考虑","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-16T09:59:14","JobVideoJd":n